          "items": [
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c06",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 6,
              "paragraph": 100,
              "text": "“可惜的是，昨天晚上在绿心公园里跟她完全没有玩够呢、所以说……”"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c06",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 6,
              "paragraph": 101,
              "text": "金色的魔法少女突然凑近到镜头前，再次露出了她那熟悉的微笑。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c06",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 6,
              "paragraph": 102,
              "text": "“如果风信子小姐你正在看这个视频的话，狐狐想要告诉你一件事。”"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c06",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 6,
              "paragraph": 103,
              "text": "“今晚七点，蓉城第三文理学院，我们不见不散~”"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c06",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 6,
              "paragraph": 104,
              "text": "金毛狐狐卖了个萌。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c06",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 6,
              "paragraph": 105,
              "text": "可紧接着，她又像是想起了什么似的，小声念叨了一句："
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c06",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 6,
              "paragraph": 106,
              "text": "“哎呀呀，如果狐狐我七点钟见不到风信子小姐的话……”"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c06",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 6,
              "paragraph": 107,
              "text": "“那么，蓉城第三文理学院的教学楼——大概会被夷为平地吧~”"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c06",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 6,
              "paragraph": 108,
              "text": "视频结束。"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c06",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 6,
              "paragraph": 109,
              "text": "发布时间8月31日下午三点，播放量已经超过了一万，同时观看人数100+。"
            }
          ],
